{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8fdfd0eeda7a72ed","type":"text","text":"# User\n- id\n- vehicle_id\n- listing_id\n- bids_array[]\n- type: enum[consumber, dealer]\n# Relations\n- Vehicle: OneToOne\n- Listing: OneToOne\n- Bid: OneToMany","x":-214,"y":-1400,"width":360,"height":421},
		{"id":"694a737b4b78ed15","type":"text","text":"# Vehicle\n- vehicle_id\n- consumer_id\n- listing_id\n- VIN\n- Year\n- Model\n- Make\n- Transmission\n- Mileage\n- Has_modifications?\n- Has_issues?\n- Location\n- file_id_array[]\n# Relations\n- Consumer: OneToOne\n- Files: OneToMany\n- Listing: OneToOne","x":-239,"y":-880,"width":410,"height":596},
		{"id":"2f77c1d315d01ffd","type":"text","text":"## Process\n- User selects a file (image or PDF) on the Next.js frontend (Mantine FileInput).\n- The frontend calls your NestJS backend asking for a pre-signed upload URL.\n- NestJS generates the pre-signed URL from DigitalOcean Spaces and returns:\n\t- uploadUrl → temporary URL where the file can be uploaded.\n\t- fileUrl → permanent public (or private) file URL in Spaces.\n- The frontend uses axios.put() to upload the file directly to Spaces, bypassing the backend.\n- Once upload succeeds, the frontend calls your NestJS /files endpoint to save file metadata (vehicle_id, file_url, mime_type, size, type=image/pdf) into PostgreSQL.\n- The vehicle listing page fetches file metadata from PostgreSQL and displays images/PDF links using the fileUrl.","x":280,"y":-676,"width":631,"height":476},
		{"id":"2a90438ad950e14e","type":"text","text":"# Bid\n- id (PK)  \n- listing_id (FK → Listing.id)  \n- dealer_id (FK → User.id)  \n- bid_amount  \n- created_at  \n- status (outbid, winning, final_winner)\n# Relations\n- Dealer: ManyToOne\n- Listing: ManyToOne","x":-890,"y":-1400,"width":379,"height":421},
		{"id":"f7b96373e458d7a0","type":"text","text":"# Transaction\n","x":346,"y":-880,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8dc3ae16a8d044ef","type":"text","text":"# Listing\n- consumer_id\n- listing_id\n- vehicle_id\n- dealer_id_array[]\n- Reserve_price\n- Buy_now_price\n- duration\n- Status: enum[<font color=\"#ffff00\">Not_started</font>, <font color=\"#4bacc6\">In_progress</font>, <font color=\"#00b050\">Complete</font>]\n- Reserve_status: enum[<font color=\"#ff0000\">Reserve_Not_Met</font>, <font color=\"#f79646\">Reserver_Nearly_Met</font>, <font color=\"#00b050\">Reserve_Met</font>]\n# Relations\n- Consumer: OneToOne or ManyToOne\n- Dealer: OneToMany\n- Vehicle: OneToOne\n- Bid: OneToMany","x":-925,"y":-858,"width":450,"height":552},
		{"id":"f3f4990fa06decce","type":"text","text":"# **Files**\n- file_id (PK)\n- vehicle_id (FK → Vehicle.vehicle_id)\n- file_type (image | pdf)\n- file_name\n- file_url \n- mime_type (image/jpeg, application/pdf, etc.)\n- size_bytes\n- uploaded_at\n- is_primary (boolean, e.g. main display photo)\n# Relations\n- Vehicle: ManyToOne","x":280,"y":-1400,"width":440,"height":444}
	],
